    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to manage your restaurant or cafe to the smallest detail ? Welcome to Mattami Restaurant &amp; Cafe Tycoon !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/ecfb28c6b1d4e66ca0e017e56079230a.poster.avif?t=1748517084\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/ecfb28c6b1d4e66ca0e017e56079230a.webm?t=1748517084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/ecfb28c6b1d4e66ca0e017e56079230a.mp4?t=1748517084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266a Mattami is a game where you start with a tiny humble place and work your way up. Manage your staff, their schedule and inventory to efficiently grow your restaurant as fast and as elegant as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/de3adec3d7caa9b238984b977610ff13.webp?t=1748517084\" width=115 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266b Manage Staff, Their Actions &amp; Their Schedule</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/bd0bc6e945463b1785e7131453e2158f.poster.avif?t=1748517084\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/bd0bc6e945463b1785e7131453e2158f.webm?t=1748517084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/de3adec3d7caa9b238984b977610ff13.webp?t=1748517084\" width=115 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266b Build Beautiful Places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/6936f1c544790eab08ef6eed2ebf1a6c.poster.avif?t=1748517084\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/6936f1c544790eab08ef6eed2ebf1a6c.webm?t=1748517084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/de3adec3d7caa9b238984b977610ff13.webp?t=1748517084\" width=115 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266a Explore New Recipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/7f09c174639858da24a1db2533b5917d.poster.avif?t=1748517084\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/7f09c174639858da24a1db2533b5917d.webm?t=1748517084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836500/extras/de3adec3d7caa9b238984b977610ff13.webp?t=1748517084\" width=115 height=21 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266b No Two Da